{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"量子几何 Langlands 纲领"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"量子几何Langlands纲领"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>量子几何 Langlands 纲领认为复曲线上 $G$-丛模空间上的扭曲 D-模的导出范畴和和 $G^L$-丛模空间的相应范畴之间存在一个等价.</p>\n<p><strong>猜想</strong> (量子 Betti 整体几何 Langlands, 参见 "},{"Local":{"url":"BogdanovaQBetti","text":"Bogdanova"}},{"Plain":").\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Sh}_{c,\\text{Nilp}}(\\mathrm{Bun}_G)\\simeq\\int_X\\mathsf{Rep}_q(\\check G).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>猜想</strong> (量子 de Rham 整体几何 Langlands).\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{DMod}_c(\\mathrm{Bun}_G) \\simeq \\mathsf{DMod}_{-1/rc}(\\mathrm{Bun}_{\\check G}).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Whittaker系数","text":null}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}